        <item>
            <title>1.004 版</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>點擊圖片連結的預覽支援 imgur 無副檔名連結（例如 imgur.com/代碼）</li>
                    <li>圖片預覽支援 webp、avif、heic 格式</li>
                    <li>YouTube 影片連結可在 Welly 內建的播放視窗播放（按住 Shift 點擊仍以瀏覽器開啟）</li>
                    <li>以上功能需在「偏好設定」>「連線」把「預設處理網址連結方式」設為「內建QuickLook開啟」</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:26:58 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/Goston/Welly-Modify/releases/download/1.004/Welly-1.004.zip" sparkle:version="5" sparkle:shortVersionString="1.004" length="12733422" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:dsaSignature="MD0CHEgGgwfAn5XZhCFOY4Ap4OUoRLupED3VFhBClI8CHQCNE1Ltld7Q4oPLaJlrkgCLw2ti27GPbdVmXE6r" />
